{"skill":{"slug":"agent-stock","displayName":"agent-stock"},"version":{"version":"0.2.8","createdAt":1777122339980,"changelog":"Release 0.2.8","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1348,"sha256":"c8454fb1efaaa25e610c975a190749b97695b76b2c7dc853c1490c7a95bc941f","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"references/holdings.md","size":2583,"sha256":"210306255ec7d4409987706504e87f31a4bdfd05739e0ca25f5859a0a95df7ef","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"references/quant.md","size":6267,"sha256":"0138e6ca8123f25c43fbcef8ce59bb5a025888b4e3c8e68a53ec426d4851832c","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"references/quant_rule.md","size":7294,"sha256":"1dcc795264d46315e6f6da523c9a8d5db9ec4a3bd55b2debadc5f2ef07b6eaa6","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"references/screen.md","size":4516,"sha256":"d6bf806cba94411a9938fc4c69977abca99fc5eec16d0ef19b80a7038faf412a","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"references/trade.md","size":7648,"sha256":"f8c7c3927c91d0bf99f3f776099ab3544e3412eca244b9d6ec72fca14b774be5","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2309,"sha256":"7c59a8e59b8aed1e835a31acbf0b8659684ecb1460603c6337a3fc1e00a72d27","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789180862169,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"eca0d8ea224948dc66150dfb8927c09002d3c52cb5678f3949e3e5fe07938a77","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/eca0d8ea224948dc66150dfb8927c09002d3c52cb5678f3949e3e5fe07938a77","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780086108750},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":39,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":9,"checkedAt":1789180862169},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is purpose-aligned for stock analysis, but it asks agents to install unpinned third-party code and save sensitive trading or holdings reports without clear user consent or financial-risk warnings.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network-backed market data and local command execution are coherent for the skill's purpose. I found no artifact URLs, credential-harvesting instructions, tool hijacking, or remote payload execution beyond the package-manager install step.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"SKILL.md instructs installing the stock CLI via unpinned `uv tool install agent-stock` or `pip3 install agent-stock`, and even helping install a Python environment if needed. That downloads and runs third-party code not included in the reviewed artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The workflows are mostly scoped to stock CLI commands and user-provided holdings, but they require saving results and then ending without a user-facing summary, which weakens visibility into side effects.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The reference workflows require writing reports under `dist/screen`, `dist/trade`, and `dist/holdings`, including potentially sensitive portfolio and trading data, without an explicit opt-in, retention guidance, or overwrite controls. No OS-level persistence or privilege escalation was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is real-time stock data, screening, trading decisions, quantitative decisions, and holdings analysis, and the reference workflows match that purpose. However, the skill gives actionable buy/sell/position-sizing guidance in a high-stakes financial domain without clear warnings that outputs are informational and may be wrong.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Install only if you trust the `agent-stock` package source and are comfortable with the agent downloading and running Python package code. Treat all trading outputs as informational, verify them independently, avoid providing brokerage credentials or unnecessary account details, and require explicit confirmation before saving holdings or trading reports locally.","findings":"[T08] expected: Use of a stock CLI is coherent with the skill, but the artifact-backed install instructions are unpinned and unverified, so the supply-chain concern is accepted as a Review-level issue rather than treated as malicious behavior.\n[SQP-2] expected: Actionable stock selection and trading guidance is central to the skill, but the absence of financial-risk and non-advice disclosures is a material high-stakes under-disclosure concern.\n[SQP-2] unexpected: The file-save instructions for holdings, trade, quant, and screening reports are real and repeated; saving reports may be useful, but mandatory silent persistence of sensitive financial analysis is not necessary to the core purpose and lacks user control.\n[SDI-1] unexpected: The top-level description does not disclose local report persistence, while reference files require writes to `dist/...`; this under-disclosure supports Review but not malicious classification.\n[SQP-3] expected: The artifact is Chinese-language throughout and appears oriented to Chinese stock-market workflows. This is a usability/localization note, not a security basis for escalation.\n[P9] expected: Manual inspection showed the whitespace finding comes from wide markdown table alignment in `references/quant.md`, with no hidden instructions or prompt-injection content found.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789180862169}}}}}